### token-savior MCP ###
# Writes a symbol index into the repo root on first use (~6 MB, grows with the codebase)
# -- derived data, regenerated on demand, never committed. The daemon also keeps state
# under ~/.local/share/token-savior, outside the repo.
.token-savior-cache.json
.token-savior/
